{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38282","headline":"厌花落 · 韩偓","name":"厌花落","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"厌花落，人寂寞。\n果树阴成燕翅齐，西园永日闲高阁。\n後堂夹帘愁不卷，低头闷把衣襟捻。\n忽然事到心中来，四肢娇入茸茸眼。\n也曾同在华堂宴，佯佯拢鬓偷回面。\n半醉狂心忍不禁，分明一任傍人见。\n书中说却平生事，犹疑未满情郎意。\n锦囊封了又重开，夜深窗下烧红纸。\n红纸千张言不尽，至诚无语传心印。\n但得鸳鸯枕臂眠，也任时光都一瞬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}